runedTree}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree10\\text{-}pruned\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree10PrunedTree}_S(T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists R_T\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nR_T=\\{\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in T\\times T:s\\subseteq t\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,R_T)\n\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\exists t\\in T\\;(s\\subsetneq t)\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree10\\text{-}pruned\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree10PrunedTree}_S(T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists R_T\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nR_T=\\{\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in T\\times T:s\\subseteq t\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,R_T)\n\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\exists t\\in T\\;(s\\subsetneq t)\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>前缀序先限制到集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\times T\">\\(T\\times T\\)</span>，再传给集合编码的树谓词；这避免把全局真类关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\subseteq\">\\(\\subseteq\\)</span> 当作集合参数。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"d25b709595952a78","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"d25b709595952a78","anchor":"ref-3","ta